<title>HONG KONG: Jardine Fleming names four fund managers.</title>
<headline>Jardine Fleming names four fund managers.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jardine Fleming said on Thursday it had appointed four investment managers to its operations in Singapore and Hong Kong.</p>
<p>In a statement issued in Hong Kong, Jardine said Joshua Tay and Desmond Lum would be based in Singapore, while Korea specialist Y.C. Park and Malaysia specialist Huzaime Hamid would work out of Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Jardine said it now has 56 investment managers in the Asia-Pacific region.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
